second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the format of \\\"Swan Princess\\\"?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 85, \"text\": \"by seven direct-to-video sequels and is the only film of the series to be theatrical.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d00\", \"start\": 86, \"end\": 176, \"text\": \"The theme song \\\"Far Longer than Forever\\\" is performed by Regina Belle and Jeffrey Osborne.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d00\", \"start\": 177, \"end\": 250, \"text\": \"The song was nominated for a Golden Globe in 1995 for Best Original Song.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d00\", \"start\": 251, \"end\": 427, \"text\": \"The evil sorcerer Rothbart (Jack Palance) is planning to take King William's (Dakin Matthews) kingdom for himself by mastering a type of dark magic known as The Forbidden Arts.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d00\", \"start\": 428, \"end\": 471, \"text\": \"Before he can strike, Rothbart is arrested.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d00\", \"start\": 472, \"end\": 554, \"text\": \"Despite calls for his death, King William spares Rothbart's life and banishes him.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d00\", \"start\": 555, \"end\": 596, \"text\": \"A hateful Rothbart swears to King William\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 67, \"text\": \"on November 18, 1994, where it received mixed reviews from critics.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d01\", \"start\": 68, \"end\": 159, \"text\": \"The Swan Princess: Music from the Motion Picture is the soundtrack album of the first film.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d01\", \"start\": 160, \"end\": 309, \"text\": \"\\\"Far Longer than Forever\\\" is the theme song for the first film \\\"The Swan Princess\\\" and was nominated for a Golden Globe Award for Best Original Song.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d01\", \"start\": 310, \"end\": 362, \"text\": \"It is performed by Regina Belle and Jeffrey Osborne.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d01\", \"start\": 363, \"end\": 577, \"text\": \"The Swan Princess: Escape from Castle Mountain / The Swan Princess: The Secret of the Castle is a 1997 American animated musical-fantasy film and the direct-to-video sequel to the animated film \\\"The Swan Princess\\\".\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d01\", \"start\": 578, \"end\": 597, \"text\": \"Directed by Richard\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 21, \"text\": \"in the previous year.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d02\", \"start\": 22, \"end\": 139, \"text\": \"Ridden by the Welsh jockey Taffy Thomas she went to the front as usual and opened up a clear lead over her opponents.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d02\", \"start\": 140, \"end\": 291, \"text\": \"She was strongly pressed in the closing stages by the favourite Band Practice (a colt from the Dermot Weld stable) but stayed on well to win by a head.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d02\", \"start\": 292, \"end\": 432, \"text\": \"Later that month she was matched against older horses in William Hill Sprint Championship at York in which she finished sixth behind Sharpo.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d02\", \"start\": 433, \"end\": 539, \"text\": \"At the end of the year Swan Princess was rated the best two-year-old filly to race in Ireland on the Irish\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 594, \"text\": \"The Swan Princess ( film series ) - Wikipedia Jump to content Main menu Main menu move to sidebar hide Navigation Main page Contents Current events Random article About Wikipedia Contact us Contribute Help Learn to edit Community portal Recent changes Upload file Special pages Search Search Appearance Donate Create account Log in Personal tools Donate Create account Log in Pages for logged out editors learn more Contributions Talk Contents move to sidebar hide ( Top ) 1 Films Toggle Films subsection 1.1 The Swan Princess ( 1994 ) 1.2 The Swan Princess : Escape from Castle Mountain ( 1997\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d03\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0441-ee600b8ae73b:d03:c0\", \"entity\": \"Swan Princess\", \"scope\": \"The Swan Princess (film series) - Wikipedia\", \"claim\": \"The Swan Princess is a film series.\", \"answer\": \"film series\", \"quote\": \"The Swan Princess ( film series ) - Wikipedia Jump to content Main menu Main menu move to sidebar hide Navigation Main page Contents Current events Random article About Wikipedia Contact us Contribute Help Learn to edit Community portal Recent changes Upload file Special pages Search Search Appearance Donate Create account Log in Personal tools Donate Create account Log in Pages for logged out editors learn more Contributions Talk Contents move to sidebar hide ( Top ) 1 Films Toggle Films subsection 1.1 The Swan Princess ( 1994 ) 1.2 The Swan Princess : Escape from Castle Mountain ( 1997\", \"orig